  "original_contracts": {
    "f1": "Exact single-call and three-call network through injected model port, token filler and envelope; actual historical 20 item-arms / 60 captured responses reproduce request, physical call, call receipt and item receipt bytes. No live model call or durable spool is covered.",
    "s2s": "Canonical training config/history and exact 38-field self-consistent optimization receipt verifier. Complete task data/strata, initialization, history/stopping/best-checkpoint and receipt commitments are recomputed. This does not replay training or admit a model.",
    "f3": "Original cache key/body, cache-first budget, failure consumption, response metadata and immutable resulting state through typed injected I/O. Provider retry/backoff and active F3 lifecycle remain outside this seam."
  },
